<title>USA: Equity Inns files $200 mln equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Equity Inns files $200 mln equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Inns Inc filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $200 million in common stock and preferred shares.</p>
<p>The Memphis-based real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used by the company's operating partnership for general corporate purposes which may include repaying outstanding debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the offering.</p>
</text>
